{"strongs": "H1499", "word": "גָּזֵל", "translit": "ge.zel", "root": "גזל", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "robbery", "definition": "גָּזֵל noun [masculine] robbery — absolute גָּזֵל Lev 5:21 +3 t. + Ezek 18:18 compare below; construct גֵּזֶל Eccl 5:7 ; Ezek 18:18 (but compare below); — robbery Lev 5:21 ( P ) Ps 62:11 (|| עשֶׁק ) Isa 61:8 = thing plundered , taken as plunder, as plunder, accusative of congnate meaning with verb Ezek 22:29 ( גָּזַל גָּזֵל ); figurative גֵּזֶל משפט = wresting of justice (compare Isa 10:2 ) Eccl 5:7 . — Ezek 18:18 has גֵּזֶל אָח , but ᵐ5 Co strike out אח ; read then גָּזֵל . — compare Lag BN 172 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1589')\">BDB1589</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1498')\">H1498</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H1499')\">H1499</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1588')\">BDB1588</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1590')\">BDB1590</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גָּזֵל</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>robbery</highlightword> — absolute <bdbheb>גָּזֵל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 5:21\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(3,5,21)\">Lev 5:21</ref> +3 t. + <ref ref=\"Ezek 18:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,18,18)\">Ezek 18:18</ref> compare below; construct <bdbheb>גֵּזֶל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 5:7\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(21,5,7)\">Eccl 5:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 18:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,18,18)\">Ezek 18:18</ref> (but compare below); — <highlight>robbery</highlight> <ref ref=\"Lev 5:21\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(3,5,21)\">Lev 5:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Ps 62:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"62\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"62\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,62,11)\">Ps 62:11</ref> (|| <bdbheb>עשֶׁק</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Isa 61:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"61\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"61\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,61,8)\">Isa 61:8</ref> = <highlight>thing plundered</highlight>, taken as plunder, as plunder, accusative of congnate meaning with verb <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:29\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,29)\">Ezek 22:29</ref> (<bdbheb>גָּזַל גָּזֵל</bdbheb>); figurative <bdbheb>גֵּזֶל משפט</bdbheb> = wresting of justice (compare <ref ref=\"Isa 10:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,2)\">Isa 10:2</ref>) <ref ref=\"Eccl 5:7\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(21,5,7)\">Eccl 5:7</ref>. — <ref ref=\"Ezek 18:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,18,18)\">Ezek 18:18</ref> has <bdbheb>גֵּזֶל אָח</bdbheb>, but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> strike out <bdbheb>אח</bdbheb>; read then <bdbheb>גָּזֵל</bdbheb>. — compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 172</sup></lookup>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Lev 5:21", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 5, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Ezek 18:18", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 18, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Eccl 5:7", "book": "ECC", "chapter": 5, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ps 62:11", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 62, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Isa 61:8", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 61, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Ezek 22:29", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 22, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Isa 10:2", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 10, "verse": 2}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["גָּזֵל", "גֵּזֶל", "עשֶׁק", "גָּזַל גָּזֵל", "גֵּזֶל משפט", "גֵּזֶל אָח", "ᵐ5", "אח"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Co", "Lag", "P", "Sept"]}, "covers": ["H1498", "H1499"], "bdbid": "BDB1589", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}